Checks: >
  -*,bugprone-*,cppcoreguidelines-pro-type-cstyle-cast,cppcoreguidelines-slicing,
  modernize-use-override,modernize-use-nullptr,performance-*,readability-braces-around-statements,
  readability-container-size-empty,misc-unused-parameters,-bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters
